OL,3,AConservative leader Kemi Badenoch about
OL,4,Ato deliver speech on final day of
OL,5,Aparty's conference
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch is
OL,8,Fabout to address her party's conference
OL,9,Fin Birmingham - you can watch the
OL,10,Fspeech live above
OL,12,FShe will commit the Tories to fighting
OL,13,Fa "battle for the soul of the nation"
OL,14,Fand is expected to say the differences
OL,15,Fbetween her party and Labour go "to the
OL,16,Fvery core of what kind of country we
OL,17,Fwant to be"
OL,19,FThe party has pledged #10bn for a UK
OL,20,Fair defence system, and proposed cuts
OL,21,Fto employer National Insurance
OL,22,Fcontributions for workers aged 21 to 24
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
