OL,3,AThree arrested after raid on gang
OL,4,Aaccused of helping migrants pretend to
OL,5,Abe gay to get asylum
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey are thought to have aided dozens
OL,8,Fof asylum claims from Bangladeshi men,
OL,9,Fclaiming they would be in fear for
OL,10,Ftheir lives if they returned home.
OL,12,FTwo people were arrested at addresses
OL,13,Fin London on Tuesday on suspicion of
OL,14,Ffraud and immigration offences, with
OL,15,FHome Office officers also seizing
OL,16,Fphones, jewellery and thousands of
OL,17,Fpounds in cash.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
