OL,3,AIsrael marks three years since
OL,4,AHamas-led 7 October 2023 attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the site of the Nova music festival,
OL,7,Fwhere 378 people were killed and 44
OL,8,Ftaken hostage, the mother of one victim
OL,9,Fsays the attacks were "dystopic,
OL,10,Funimaginable"
OL,12,F"What happened here was not human,"
OL,13,Fsays Ahuva Yavin Mayze, whose daughter
OL,14,Fwas shot dead at the festival
OL,16,FIn response to the 7 October attacks,
OL,17,FIsrael launched a military offensive in
OL,18,FGaza in which more than 74,200 people
OL,19,Fhave been killed, according to the
OL,20,FHamas-run health ministry
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
